(
 ']ListRepos [owner] -verbose -permanent -issues  -sort=[name|issues] -forks'
 ''
 'Lists all repositories owned by the given owner or, if no argument is passed, the default'
 'owner specified in the configuration file. No forks are listed but see -forks flag'
 ''
 'Returns just the names of the repos, but check -verbose'
 'By default the list is ordered by repo name, but when -issues is specified the default sort'
 'order is by the tally of issue. You can specify a particular sort order with -sort=, see there.'
 ''
 '-verbose    Returns more data: name, number of open issues and description.'
 '-issues     If specified, only repos are listed that have open issues.'
 '-sort=      You can enforce a particular sort oder by assigning "name" or "issues" to -sort'
 '            Is ignored when -html is specified.'
 '-forks      By default no forks are listed. By specifying this you can list just forks instead.'
 '-permanent  Saves the given owner in the configuration file. If no owner is specified and'
 '            this flag is specified then an error is thrown.'
 ''
)
